ngspice (bundled at vendor/Spice64/)
------------------------------------

This package includes an unmodified binary distribution of **ngspice 46**
for Windows x64, originally obtained from:

    https://sourceforge.net/projects/ngspice/files/ng-spice-rework/46/ngspice-46_64.7z

ngspice is open-source software released under a BSD-style license. The
complete copyright and license text is preserved in the bundle at:

    vendor/Spice64/docs/COPYING

For source code, documentation and project information, see:

    https://ngspice.sourceforge.io/

ngspice is not modified. To keep the bundle small, only the parts used by
this skill's batch-mode self-check are included. The following were removed
from the original archive (files that remain are byte-identical):

    bin/ngspice.exe                (GUI build; ngspice_con.exe is kept)
    examples/                      (sample circuits)
    lib/ngspice/*.osdi             (OSDI models; not loaded, spinit unsets osdi_enabled)
    lib/ngspice/ivlng.dll, ivlng.vpi  (Icarus Verilog co-simulation)

Download the full archive from the URL above if you need any of them.
